OL,3,AThick fog disrupts morning travel as
OL,4,Ayellow weather warnings in effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FYellow weather warnings for dense fog
OL,7,Fremain in effect across parts of the UK
OL,8,Fas low visibility disrupts travel on
OL,9,FMonday morning.
OL,11,FA Met Office warning is in place across
OL,12,Fmuch of England and eastern Wales and
OL,13,Fruns until 11:00 GMT on Monday. An
OL,14,Fadditional fog warning has been issued
OL,15,Ffor Northern Ireland running until
OL,16,F10:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
